  "description": "⭐ <em>Indulge in the ultimate Bottomless Sunday Roast at Smith’s Bar &amp; Grill, where Sundays are all about endless feasting. Enjoy unlimited small plates, bottomless roasts, and decadent desserts</em><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🍽️ Unlimited small plates, mouthwatering roasts, and indulgent desserts<br> 🥩 Choose from British beef, slow-roasted lamb, crispy pork belly, or whole baby chicken<br> 🥂 Upgrade with 90 minutes of free-flowing red, white, or sparkling wine, or a weekly cocktail<br> 🍷 Relax in a stylish setting with great company and an unbeatable Sunday atmosphere<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Date: Choose in the ticket selector<br> ⏳ Time: 12pm - 9pm<br> 📍 Venue: Smith’s Bar &amp; Grill, London<br> 💰 Bottomless Roast: Unlimited small plates, roasts &amp; desserts<br> 🍾 Bottomless Roast &amp; Free-Flowing Drinks: Includes bottomless wine and Bloody Marys<br> ⏰ Table time: 1.5-hour sitting per booking<br> 📌 Guests can order two small plates at a time, followed by one roast and one dessert at a time<br> 🚨 The entire table must dine from the Bottomless Menu<br><br><strong>Description</strong><br>Smith’s Bar &amp; Grill brings you Paddington’s most indulgent Sunday tradition - the&nbsp;<strong>Bottomless Roast</strong>. From 12pm to 9pm, settle in for<em>&nbsp;90 minutes of unlimited small plates, premium roast meats and decadent desserts - all for&nbsp;</em><strong><em>£42 per person.</em></strong><br><br>Expect generous plates of 35-day matured Picanha, roasted pork belly, lamb shank and&nbsp;baby chicken, served with golden roast potatoes, Yorkshire puddings and all the right trimmings.<br><br>Want to go all in? Add<strong>&nbsp;90 minutes of bottomless drinks for £18pp</strong>. From crisp white and bold red to bubbles, and the ultimate Sunday staple - the Bloody Mary. Spiced, savoury and made for slow sipping, it’s the drink your Sunday deserves.<br><br>Ticket options:<br>• <strong>Bottomless Roast (£42pp)</strong>&nbsp;- unlimited small plates, roasts &amp; desserts&nbsp;<br>• <strong>Bottomless Roast + Drinks (£60pp) -&nbsp;</strong>all the above, plus bottomless drinks<br><br>Whether it’s a hangover cure or just your favourite way to end the week - bring your people and let the plates keep coming.&nbsp;<strong>Limited tickets available - book now.</strong><br><br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.smithsbarandgrill.co.uk/menus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Menu Here.</a><br><br>Ts &amp; Cs apply: <br>The whole table must dine from the Bottomless Roast Menu only. <br>Table is time-limited to 1.5 hours per booking. <br>Available&nbsp;every Sunday between 12pm - 9pm only, with bookings essential. <br>Guests can order&nbsp;<strong>two small plates at a time</strong>, followed by&nbsp;<strong>one roast and one dessert at a time</strong>. Each course must be ordered separately. <br>Your drink will be replaced once it has been finished. <br>Price is per person and drinks cannot be shared. <br>Drinks cannot be substituted with any other drink. <br>Last orders are 15 minutes before the end of your sitting. <br>Food allergen information is available upon request. <br>12.5% service charge will be added to your final bill.<br>The bottomless offer is available for the entire table only. <br>All guests must choose the same package: either “Bottomless Food &amp; Drinks” or “Bottomless Food Only.” Bottomless alcohol can be substituted for bottomless soft drinks at the same price.<br>",
